{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"麻衣ナスイオン～\n永遠にまいみん、永みんです～\nとか自分で言っといて\nうまいこと言えてない感がじわる、\n川後です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/31/3629492/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっほ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の記事にコメントいっぱい\nありがと～(｡-_-｡)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱあの狂気的な画像みんなすきなのね\n嬉しい。(｡-_-｡)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"推しメン画像に変えて\nみんなも真似っこしちゃってください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/31/3629492/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/31/3629492/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/31/3629492/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/31/3629492/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミスiD2017が\nエントリー開始～～きた～！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/31/3629492/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/31/3629492/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わ～ミスiDおばさんとしては\n今年もハンパない子たちが集うと思うと\nうずうず、、、いや～楽しみ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂工事中でわたしがミスiDを紹介して\n興味持ってくれたファンとかひなのファンの中にいて嬉しいんだよ～好きな子を紹介し共感されんのって滅茶苦茶うれしいんだ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや～ただただオタクとして楽しみだ～\n2016のお披露目会いってたけど興奮やばかったもんね、！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の推しはいつでも一番だしグランプリだしセンターなんだよね！結局！だけどそこに向けて本人が頑張ってる姿とか戦ってる姿みるのって面白い！あと何かに結びついた時の嬉しさ半端じゃないよね！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/31/3629492/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/31/3629492/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛い子をただただ眺めるお仕事したい～\n可愛いって色々あってビジュアルだけじゃない！可愛いって正義なんだよね、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/31/3629492/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/31/3629492/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/31/3629492/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/31/3629492/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Popteen発売日！！！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/31/3629492/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなたんを是非チェックしてください！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"popteenみて好きになったっていう方とか\n実際に存在してて本当に感謝の限り、、、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/31/3629492/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/31/3629492/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして\nわたしきっかけで\n他のメンバーもpopteenに登場させていただいたりとか自分ってアンダーだけど微力ながらも繋げれてるって思えるとまだまだ未熟すぎるくらいに未熟だけどね、本当にうれしい。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/31/3629492/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝のニュースとかでも\n乃木坂のモデル紹介とかでさ\n川後をいれてくれてたりして\nすっごいありがたい、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと頑張んなきゃ！\nみんなの応援の声が必要です、、、\nアンケートいっぱい頑張って送ってくれたり\n本当に本当に感謝してもしきれない、\n恩を仕事で返していきます頑張ります、\nこれからもよろしくお願いします、>_<"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/31/3629492/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/03/31/3629492/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の記事自分の写真なさすぎたから\n自撮りいっぱいだ、ごめん～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいぴち"}],"source":"archive"}